{
 "version": 1,
 "language": "en",
 "notes": [
  "Shared by Marquee (rust-modules/data/src/metadata/auto_tracks.rs checks every case) and the phone apps.",
  "audio[].original is the title's original-language track, dub any track in another language. Marquee marks the original from the Plex Country tags (first country whose language the file has; anime falls back to Japanese).",
  "anime is Plex genre Anime, or genres Animation + country Japan.",
  "Sidecars are SRT. Anime: .en.srt matches the original audio; .en.cc.srt (hearingImpaired) matches the English dub. Films and non-anime TV: exactly one .en.srt; .en.cc.srt stands in when .en.srt is missing.",
  "Sidecar order of preference: matching external, then any external, then an embedded text track (same variant order). Never a picture track, never forced or signs-only, never a server burn.",
  "remembered.audio / remembered.subtitle are the viewer's explicit choice for this title or show; subtitle is a stream id, or \"off\". An id the file does not have is ignored.",
  "expect.audio null: the choice has no opinion (the server's and the file's defaults apply). expect.subtitle null: subtitles off."
 ],
